<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1075792543"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:08.413"><div begin="28.810" end="53.317"><p begin="28.810" end="34.355" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.810" end="29.503">谁能够</span><span begin="29.503" end="30.126">将</span><span begin="30.915" end="31.359">天上</span><span begin="31.359" end="31.727">月</span><span begin="31.727" end="32.546">亮</span> <span begin="32.722" end="33.096">电源</span><span begin="33.096" end="33.491">关</span><span begin="33.491" end="34.355">掉</span></p><p begin="35.761" end="41.071" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.761" end="36.458">它把你</span><span begin="36.458" end="37.148">我</span><span begin="37.959" end="38.359">沉默</span> <span begin="38.359" end="38.760">照</span><span begin="38.760" end="39.534">得</span><span begin="39.578" end="40.144">太明</span><span begin="40.144" end="41.071">瞭</span></p><p begin="42.710" end="48.088" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.710" end="43.254">关</span><span begin="43.254" end="43.806">于爱</span><span begin="43.806" end="44.376">情</span><span begin="44.866" end="45.768">我们了</span><span begin="45.768" end="46.687">解</span><span begin="46.908" end="47.475">得太</span><span begin="47.475" end="48.088">少</span></p><p begin="49.668" end="53.317" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.668" end="50.249">爱了以</span><span begin="50.249" end="50.934">后</span> <span begin="50.934" end="51.820">又不</span><span begin="51.820" end="52.087">觉</span><span begin="52.087" end="52.618">可</span><span begin="52.618" end="53.317">靠</span></p></div><div begin="54.037" end="1:07.697"><p begin="54.037" end="59.079" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.037" end="55.796">你和</span><span begin="55.796" end="56.795">我</span> <span begin="56.795" end="57.331">看</span><span begin="57.331" end="57.947">着霓</span><span begin="57.947" end="59.079">虹</span></p><p begin="59.915" end="1:02.323" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.915" end="1:00.445">